Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.27,0:03:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去问问 - 嗯 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got point? - Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样漂泊了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's it been like that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.75,0:03:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前跟过两队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with one group and another one after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没撑过来吗 两队都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't make it? Neither one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃·斯图基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob Stookey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有营地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people have a camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了多少行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many walkers have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没数过 十几个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't kept count. A couple dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people you kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和我们一起走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any questions for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.15,0:04:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:22.24,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正好咬到了绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got me right on the bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说不让你抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是叫疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是叫疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接近了吗 - 快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we close? - Almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都有踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signs are all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学会辨位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to know how to read 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在追踪什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we tracking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你想学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西经过了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.52,0:07:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,路线弯弯曲曲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pattern is all zig-zaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是个醉汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越擅长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我就不需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon I won't need you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 继续追踪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, keep on tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚能动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you move it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该等到雾散\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should wait till the fog clears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经等了一阵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been waiting a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚只是幸运而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see all this? We got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要能见度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩六发子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got six bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们按计划行事一直很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been doing good following the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不能草率\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to get sloppy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳东升西落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun comes up in the east, sets in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意观察就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep an eye on it in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能等一会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we… can we hold up a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐一会儿就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说真的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来背你 跳上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a serious piggyback. Jump up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比看起来要重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're heavier than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里可能还有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there are people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有 我来收拾他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if there are, I'll handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有好人的 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still good people, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为好人能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think the good ones survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:49.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生于1837年11月12日 卒于1874年12月10日 慈父）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:23.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（避难所和社区欢迎所有人 抵达就能活命）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去兽医院的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were out on the run to the veterinary college,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在广播上听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}we heard a message about this on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在广播吗 - 说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were broadcasting? - What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看了这个才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only know because I'm seeing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「抵达就能活命」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Those who arrive survive."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是在找格伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were looking for Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他看到这样的牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he saw one of these,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会知道我去这里找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would go looking for me looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这地图 所有路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this map. All these tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都通往同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}from different directions leading to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且我们不知道有没有其它的牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we don't know if there are other signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会认为只有这一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think this is the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是目前最好的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best lead we've had so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说是避难所 更值得试一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says sanctuary. That's just another reason to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱里的其他人也可能去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others from the prison could be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事如果听上去太美好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it sounds too good to be true…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许格伦看到这牌子后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if Glenn saw one of these,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想法和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe he felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的 我知道他有信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't. He'd believe, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想怎样 萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do, Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,围着大巴绕圈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep making these circles from the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是让我们做别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you talking about us starting to do something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想投票还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take a vote or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.13,0:13:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been tending to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人也许还在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}May still be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.12,0:14:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脚踝包扎一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get that ankle wrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来某人没洋娃娃来玩穿衣游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like somebody ran out of dolls to dress up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.64,0:14:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在乎这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们希望这些人能有一场葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted these people to get a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还记得它们曾经是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They remembered these things were people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一切发生之前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最后一刻依然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't let it change them in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得这很美吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that's beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拾柴火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting more firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在流血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们应该停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.63,0:15:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 玛姬 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Maggie, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是因为这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你不明白自己为什么想停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you know why you want to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 今早发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, what happened this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对我们的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.06,0:15:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next time it's on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odds are Glenn is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也可能会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odds are we will be, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.39,0:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩六发子弹 而且你还在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got six bullets and you're still bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些轨道会穿过一些城镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those tracks, they run through towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在最近的城里找座房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one we see, we find a building,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在制高点栖身\N{\fnArial\fs30}some higher ground to set up in. All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我们要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能说服她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can talk her into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生酱和果酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peanut butter and jelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,无糖汽水 还有猪蹄罐头\N{\fnArial\fs30}diet soda, and pig's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.60,0:17:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准的懒汉早午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a white trash brunch right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all looks good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西一尘不染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't a speck of dust on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明是有人刚放进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means somebody just put it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是某人的补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is someone's stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们就拿一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他都留下 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of it and we'll leave the rest, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knew what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我之前说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有好人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are still good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪蹄归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, those pig's feet are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.26,0:17:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 夏日的松树 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Pine for summer. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 然后我们要买 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Then we'll buy. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一瓶啤酒一饮而尽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A beer to shotgun. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们要躺在草地上 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll lay on our lawn. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们将一切安好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And we'll be good… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里封锁好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is nailed up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的入口是前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way in is through the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我几年来睡过最舒服的床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the comfiest bed I've had in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续弹吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go ahead and play some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是讨厌我唱歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought my singing annoyed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有点唱机 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There ain't no jukebox, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 然后我们要买 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And we'll buy… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一瓶啤酒一饮而尽 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A beer to shotgun. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们要躺在草地上 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We'll lay on the lawn. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们将一切安好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And we'll be good. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今我嘲笑着我的无聊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Now I'm laughing at my boredom. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.65,0:19:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 和我失败的尝试… ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And my string of failed attempts… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:47.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别为了我冒险 祝好运）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定顺着轨道走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got to follow the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能跟上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still catch up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能跟上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can still catch up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（避难所和社区欢迎所有人 抵达就能活命）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从平安地逃离监狱后 你就一直笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been grinning since we left the prison in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果活着让你这么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're so happy to be alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们为什么还要朝黑暗的深处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why are we walking into the heart of darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我活着没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about me being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.84,0:21:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道自己为什么笑么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know why you're smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.47,0:21:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我没落单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去第一队人后 我落单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it happened when I lost my first group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my second group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我破了这个记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke that streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做是你 也会笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be smiling, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.09,0:21:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,自我意识真是个好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-awareness is a beautiful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.67,0:21:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪天也该试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 不打算接话吗 - 才不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you're not going to take the bait? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时候真跟她一样倔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just as bullheaded as she is sometimes. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:20.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格伦 去终点站 玛姬留）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.17,0:22:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正全速前进呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.21,0:22:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,开吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条该死的狗而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a damn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 但你不是说有条狗吗 达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, Daryl, you said there was a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定它会跑回来 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll come back around. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.21,0:23:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.17,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见它了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.61,0:23:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它这样快一个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been that way for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定被卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be stuck on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上的声音真多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of noise at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.14,0:24:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝉 猫头鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cicadas, owls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真是阴魂不散\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think sometimes they go in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我一个人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, when I was out here by myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.97,0:24:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是睡不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sleep much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也睡不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not sleeping much now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要睡觉养伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to heal. You need to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.51,0:24:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.61,0:24:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 我们在这里算是干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, what the hell are we doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.68,0:24:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你认为泰尔西死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think Tyreese is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 如果泰尔西活着 他会去终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - If Tyreese were alive, he'd go for Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.71,0:25:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你认为他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why do you think he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.89,0:25:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕知道他的生死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you just too afraid to find out if he is or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 我都觉得你是我遇到最顽强的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up until now, I thought you were the toughest person I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.78,0:25:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is kind of weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.52,0:25:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你也是最贴心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you were the sweetest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.81,0:25:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.93,0:25:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留一张感谢卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna leave a thank-you note.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.76,0:25:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来能看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}For when they come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.25,0:26:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们会回来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.87,0:26:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他们不回来 我还是想说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if they're not coming back, I still want to say thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.11,0:26:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不用留话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't have to leave that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.68,0:26:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以在这里住一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we stick around here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.01,0:26:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.39,0:26:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以想办法共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll just make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.05,0:26:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们脑袋不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may be nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.65,0:26:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许一切都会安好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe it'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.13,0:26:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你觉得还是有好人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you do think there are still good people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.54,0:26:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.50,0:27:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别哼唧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么改变了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.67,0:27:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再给那条狗一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give that mutt one more chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.68,0:27:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth! Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.21,0:27:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.78,0:27:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.55,0:27:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 撬开窗户 拿上你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, pry open a window. Get your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.49,0:27:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.78,0:27:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 去路上 我去那里找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out. Go up the road. I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.56,0:27:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.54,0:27:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝 贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth! Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.77,0:29:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.15,0:29:36.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格伦 去终点站 玛姬留）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.90,0:29:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是沿着轨道走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's keeping to the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.44,0:29:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们加快速度 就能追上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we pick up the pace, we'll catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.37,0:31:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,高且安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure and high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.07,0:31:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们搭个东西接雨水\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can set up something to catch the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在屋顶上瞭望 寻找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we could move from the rooftops to look for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.58,0:31:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面种点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even try to grow some up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.35,0:31:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙 我不会停下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha, I'm not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.70,0:31:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.09,0:31:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.02,0:31:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她孤身在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.75,0:31:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想让我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want us to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做出了自己的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made her choice for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.07,0:31:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.57,0:31:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她落单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.94,0:31:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚到监狱时心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I got to the prison, I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.37,0:31:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光飞逝 还要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How long? The clock's ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.18,0:31:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人会死光\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until everyone else is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又只剩下我一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm on my own?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.41,0:31:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我害怕 才发生了坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad things happened 'cause I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.55,0:31:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事未必会发生 我不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't need to. I didn't need to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果到了终点站 泰尔西不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we get to Terminus and Tyreese isn't there,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:31:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不意味着他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't mean he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.93,0:32:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不用害怕 - 我没有害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't need to be afraid. - I am not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.91,0:32:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就此分别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.78,0:32:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定非要分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.43,0:32:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要冒险做件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.82,0:32:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.19,0:33:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必再孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.05,0:35:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.76,0:35:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.80,0:36:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.46,0:36:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.69,0:36:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.76,0:36:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for another walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.67,0:36:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果碰到了好多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found more than I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.24,0:36:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躺在那的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was lying there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.21,0:36:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I remembered…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.24,0:36:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了你在营地说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard what you said back at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见你说 你认为我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you say you thought we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}be in a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.02,0:37:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还听见我说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did you hear me say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.17,0:37:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦可能已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That odds are Glenn is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.33,0:37:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.94,0:37:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.88,0:37:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.38,0:37:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.88,0:37:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人没法做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I can't do it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.00,0:37:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我赶上鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if I catch up to Bob,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.82,0:38:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠我跟他也做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.22,0:38:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为我不敢求你以身犯险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that I couldn't ask you to risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.42,0:38:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你冒险为的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I know what you'd be risking it for.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.74,0:38:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止是为了格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't just Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.46,0:38:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get that you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.12,0:38:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.83,0:38:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.19,0:38:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.69,0:38:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.21,0:38:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go get Bob…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去避难所吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let's get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.00,0:39:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.75,0:39:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的背心我要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm claiming the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.19,0:39:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢上面的翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like them wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.91,0:39:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.90,0:39:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,弩手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.27,0:39:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很敬佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.71,0:39:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着来复枪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, a man with a rifle,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.17,0:39:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前可能是摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could have been some kind of photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.65,0:39:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或足球教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}or soccer coach back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但弩手自始至终不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a bowman's a bowman through and through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.22,0:39:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上拿的是150磅张弓力吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got there, 150-pound draw weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.30,0:39:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be donkey-licked if.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.62,0:40:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能达到每秒三百英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}that don't fire at least 300 feet per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找这样的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for a weapon like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 最好能多几支箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I'd want one with a bit more ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.48,0:40:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,少点污渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and minus the oblongata stains.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.46,0:40:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇到麻烦了吗 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself in some trouble, partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.25,0:40:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你扣下扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pull that trigger,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.51,0:40:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把你射成蜂窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}these boys are gonna drop you several times over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样伙计 自杀多蠢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, fella, suicide is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,害己不如害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hurt yourself when you can hurt other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.96,0:40:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.52,0:40:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.43,0:41:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.30,0:42:11.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（避难所和社区欢迎所有人 抵达就能活命）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.81,0:42:22.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（终点站）
